# Save S-Record ranges and the replace question (docs/porting/easybin.md 11).
reset
loadbin bin70k.BIN 00F000 0
fill 000000 00004F 5A
savesrec small.S68 000000 000050 00001234 Yes
savesrec cross.S68 00FFC0 010041 00FFC0 Yes
savesrec empty.S68 001000 001000 00000000 Yes
savesrec backwards.S68 001001 001000 00000000 Yes
savesrec big.S68 00F000 020000 FFFFFFFF Yes
savesrec small.S68 000000 000010 00000000 No
savesrec small.S68 000000 000010 00000000 Yes
savesrec odd.S68 000001 000022 ABCDEF12 Yes
reset
loadsrec big.S68
digest
loadsrec cross.S68
loadsrec empty.S68
